---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: email-confirmed.html
noindex: true
analytics: false
titleId: email-confirmed.title
descriptionId: meta.email-confirmed.description
---
{#- Where the link in Ascend's sign-up confirmation email lands (A2 E1, E4).
    Not linked from the nav, the footer or any page, and noindex keeps it out
    of the sitemap. No analytics beacon: the address can carry a one-time
    ?code= or an #error, which email-confirmed.js clears. Without JavaScript
    the page shows the confirmed copy; with it, a link that GoTrue refused
    swaps in the data-msg-failed copy. -#}
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">{{ copy["email-confirmed.label"] }}</p>
      <h1 class="display" data-email-confirmed data-msg-failed="{{ copy['email-confirmed.failed.heading'] }}">{{ copy["email-confirmed.heading"] }}</h1>
      <p data-email-confirmed data-msg-failed="{{ copy['email-confirmed.failed.line'] }}">{{ copy["email-confirmed.line"] }}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/email-confirmed.js"></script>
